OL,3,GNEWSACatherine Zeta-Jones' daughter    
OL,4,Asays parents warned her about 'nepo    
OL,5,Ababy' label                            
OL,7,FZeta-Jones, who is married to Michael  
OL,8,FDouglas, son of Hollywood star Kirk,   
OL,9,Fpreviously said the "nepo baby" term   
OL,10,Fwas "horrific". It refers to children  
OL,11,Fof famous parents perceived to have    
OL,12,Fachieved riches and success off their  
OL,13,Fparents' backs.                        
OL,15,FBut the young actor said her parents   
OL,16,Ftaught her to build her "own identity" 
OL,17,Fand she has learned how to deal with   
OL,18,Fthe "pressure".                        
